 "description": "Top event: the propane fraction in mixer MX-01 / surge tank ST-01 falls into the flammable range because propane is lost or air is over-supplied while blowers B-01/B-02 keep running, and both mixture protections fail. Protection (gate G-002) = low propane pressure trip PSLL-01 (stops the blowers, closes XV-01 / XV-02) AND the calorimeter trip AT-01. PSLL-01 cannot see a ratio-controller fault (BE-010). Gate G-002 is the mixture barrier of bow tie BT-PR-02 (threat T1). HAZOP N03-01; FMECA S03. Illustrative data from the toolkit's data library – replace with site / vendor data before use. Propane storage and dilution worked example (HAZOP HZ-EX-PR-001).",
